        "text": "The target is Arizona's state row, not a national total or weighted average. CMS dataset 5abea2e0-3f8e-4b49-a50d-d63d5fd9103c identifies O as original and U as updated. CMS's state tables define ex parte rates using beneficiaries due for renewal as the denominator: Metric 5a(1) divided by Metric 5. All historical anchors below use initial reporting-period tables, excluding quarterly updated-renewal tables."
      },
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "text": "Evidence limitation: the dataset metadata was fetched, but raw CSV and API requests were inaccessible through the web tool. Raw Arizona ex parte numerator counts were not fetched. HistoricalContext therefore records CMS's published whole-percent snapshot values, not reconstructed one-decimal raw-row shares. The forecast still resolves using the first-published original-row counts."
